  takeLabel: "Afet \xE7antan\u0131 al"
  emptyLabel: "Afet \xE7antas\u0131na bak"
  title: "Afet \xC7antas\u0131"
  readyText: "\xC7antan haz\u0131r ve kapal\u0131. Sars\u0131nt\u0131 s\u0131ras\u0131nda \xE7antayla u\u011Fra\u015Fma; \xF6nce \xC7\xF6k\u2013Kapan\u2013Tutun. Sars\u0131nt\u0131 bitince al."
  emptyAfterText: "\xC7antan bo\u015F! Su, yiyecek, ilk yard\u0131m seti ve el feneri depremden \xD6NCE haz\u0131rlanmal\u0131yd\u0131."
  reminderPrepared: "\xC7\u0131kmadan \xF6nce odandaki afet \xE7antan\u0131 al."
  reminderUnprepared: "Afet \xE7antan\u0131 haz\u0131rlamam\u0131\u015Ft\u0131n. Bir dahaki sefere sars\u0131nt\u0131dan \xD6NCE haz\u0131rla ve kolay ula\u015F\u0131lan bir yerde tut."
  takenToast: "Afet \xE7antan\u0131 ald\u0131n: su, yiyecek, ilk yard\u0131m seti, el feneri ve d\xFCd\xFCk yan\u0131nda."
